# Root workspaces lockfile: Windows-generated lockfiles prune Linux platform
# bindings (npm/cli#4828) and break Railway's Linux builds. The Railway
# builder resolves fresh instead; per-app lockfiles remain the source of
# truth for local dev.
/package-lock.json

